  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NDICI GEO ASIA PACIFIC/2025/FPI03/ACT-63052/JAG.SUM.2051963/Digital Partnerships and digital cooperation in action in the Asia Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action will support the implementation of Digital Partnerships and digital cooperation. It will focus on countries in the Asia Pacific region, primarily on Japan, Republic of Korea, and Singapore, and potentially on Australia and New Zealand. It will seek to enhance the knowledge and benefits of the Digital Partnerships and cooperation by focusing on various key thematic areas, including on the digital economy, digital connectivity, digital governance, digital entrepreneurship, digital skills and security of digital technologies and infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
